# Overrides .dockerignore for Dockerfile.dev specifically (BuildKit checks
# for <dockerfile-name>.dockerignore first) - Dockerfile.dev's entire point
# is COPYing bin/backend in, so it can't be excluded here the way it
# correctly is for the real Dockerfile (which compiles inside Docker and
# never wants a stray local bin/ in its build context).
.git
*.env
.env*
